(6943719, 1046717, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful and strange. The wrapped furniture is wicked clever. Not sure why he''s poking the ornament but the red and green light works well. A technical nit for me is that the source light for his face is a mystery. It is neither glowing from the fire (which would be the logical source, but it is hidden behind the ornament) or the right color.</td>', 'This is so beautiful and strange. The wrapped furniture is wicked clever. Not sure why he''s poking the ornament but the red and green light works well. A technical nit for me is that the source light for his face is a mystery. It is neither glowing from the fire (which would be the logical source, but it is hidden behind the ornament) or the right color.', '2012-12-28 21:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6943726, 1046733, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a story - the car veering through the cold pines to get home for the holidays.  I love it.</td>', 'What a story - the car veering through the cold pines to get home for the holidays.  I love it.', '2012-12-28 21:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
