(6943818, 1046421, 124815, '<td valign="top">The fickle memory. Magical picture. 10<br/>I would suggest a different title. Virgil Tempus fugit: Sed fugit interea fugit irreparabile tempus, singula dum capti circumvectamur amore<br/>("But meanwhile it flees: time flees irretrievably, while we wander around, prisoners of our love of detail.")</td>', 'The fickle memory. Magical picture. 10I would suggest a different title. Virgil Tempus fugit: Sed fugit interea fugit irreparabile tempus, singula dum capti circumvectamur amore("But meanwhile it flees: time flees irretrievably, while we wander around, prisoners of our love of detail.")', '2012-12-28 22:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
