(6946849, 1046717, 63218, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1046796" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg"/></a> <br/>The Flying Pig Honorable Mention awarded in recognition of fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenge entries. See previous awards &amp; comments in <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1171726&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">The Flying Pig</a> thread.<br/> <br/>This is amazing. On the surface, at first glance, it''s so real, so accessible. In the details, it''s so surreal. I zoomed my screen to the max on it, &amp; WOW. This composition seems to illustrate a story that is unfamiliar, that I can''t figure out. I enjoy the looking.</td>', ' The Flying Pig Honorable Mention awarded in recognition of fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenge entries. See previous awards & comments in The Flying Pig thread. This is amazing. On the surface, at first glance, it''s so real, so accessible. In the details, it''s so surreal. I zoomed my screen to the max on it, & WOW. This composition seems to illustrate a story that is unfamiliar, that I can''t figure out. I enjoy the looking.', '2013-01-01 22:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6947013, 1046646, 63218, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1046796" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg"/></a> <br/>The Flying Pig Honorable Mention is awarded in recognition of fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenges. See previous awards &amp; comments in <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1171726&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">The Flying Pig</a> thread.<br/> <br/>OMG! A Flip''n''Blend! I like the off-axis rotation, the lush color, the mind-boggling detail, &amp; most of all, that Star in the middle. What a great idea. If you haven''t already done it, I hope you''ll post a full-sized version. It would be awesome.</td>', ' The Flying Pig Honorable Mention is awarded in recognition of fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenges. See previous awards & comments in The Flying Pig thread. OMG! A Flip''n''Blend! I like the off-axis rotation, the lush color, the mind-boggling detail, & most of all, that Star in the middle. What a great idea. If you haven''t already done it, I hope you''ll post a full-sized version. It would be awesome.', '2013-01-02 01:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6947527, 1046730, 20799, '<td valign="top">A true December, simple and beautiful. I like when a picture makes me imagine the sounds of the scene... this one does it so perfectly. 10</td>', 'A true December, simple and beautiful. I like when a picture makes me imagine the sounds of the scene... this one does it so perfectly. 10', '2013-01-02 15:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6947528, 1046572, 20799, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous dissection.</td>', 'Gorgeous dissection.', '2013-01-02 15:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6947531, 1046734, 20799, '<td valign="top">Depth, life and sound. Impressive winter coloring too. 10</td>', 'Depth, life and sound. Impressive winter coloring too. 10', '2013-01-02 15:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6947543, 1046717, 20799, '<td valign="top">Great horrorized Christmas colors. The abundance of elements feels gyabanesque :) especially the ball in front. But for this scene, I honestly think it''s not the right approach. The wrapped furniture a-la Raymond''s parents will get you a ribbon for sure! :)).</td>', 'Great horrorized Christmas colors. The abundance of elements feels gyabanesque :) especially the ball in front. But for this scene, I honestly think it''s not the right approach. The wrapped furniture a-la Raymond''s parents will get you a ribbon for sure! :)).', '2013-01-02 15:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6947548, 1046713, 20799, '<td valign="top">Unbelievably beautiful color. I wonder if this is exactly the way you saw it.</td>', 'Unbelievably beautiful color. I wonder if this is exactly the way you saw it.', '2013-01-02 15:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6947773, 1046698, 112739, '<td valign="top">This is one gorgeous image. The comp pulls you in and wants to be right there skiing along. The contrast of color and white really makes this image great.</td>', 'This is one gorgeous image. The comp pulls you in and wants to be right there skiing along. The contrast of color and white really makes this image great.', '2013-01-02 21:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6947775, 1046374, 112739, '<td valign="top">Cold morning or evening in the dead of winter. Beautiful image.</td>', 'Cold morning or evening in the dead of winter. Beautiful image.', '2013-01-02 21:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6947784, 1046608, 112739, '<td valign="top">Love this!</td>', 'Love this!', '2013-01-02 21:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6947818, 1046641, 63218, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1046796" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg"/></a> <br/>The Flying Pig Honorable Mention is awarded in recognition of fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenges. See previous awards &amp; comments in <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1171726&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">The Flying Pig</a> thread.<br/> <br/>You almost have a rainbow here. Maybe that''s why I''m thinking of sunflowers, in spite of the fact that I''ve never worn a wetsuit in my life. This is gentle &amp; adventuresome at the same time. Adventuresome because it puts me down below, where the monsters are.</td>', ' The Flying Pig Honorable Mention is awarded in recognition of fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenges. See previous awards & comments in The Flying Pig thread. You almost have a rainbow here. Maybe that''s why I''m thinking of sunflowers, in spite of the fact that I''ve never worn a wetsuit in my life. This is gentle & adventuresome at the same time. Adventuresome because it puts me down below, where the monsters are.', '2013-01-02 23:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6947823, 1046452, 63218, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1046796" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg"/></a> <br/>The Flying Pig Honorable Mention is awarded in recognition of fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenges. See previous awards &amp; comments in <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1171726&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">The Flying Pig</a> thread.<br/> <br/>Baby birds, acting like boys. "D I do like the Light, the dark tones, the motion blur. And that ledge implies a big precipice.</td>', ' The Flying Pig Honorable Mention is awarded in recognition of fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenges. See previous awards & comments in The Flying Pig thread. Baby birds, acting like boys. "D I do like the Light, the dark tones, the motion blur. And that ledge implies a big precipice.', '2013-01-02 23:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
