(6947991, 1046713, 30712, '<td valign="top">What a well behaved bird.  It''s so small and yet without it the impact of this picture would be so much less.</td>', 'What a well behaved bird.  It''s so small and yet without it the impact of this picture would be so much less.', '2013-01-03 10:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
