(6948035, 1046730, 101256, '<td valign="top">Washed out and not very interesting - not trying to be a jerk, but it''s true. There is nothing really interesting in this image and the rather dull color doesn''t help it any either.</td>', 'Washed out and not very interesting - not trying to be a jerk, but it''s true. There is nothing really interesting in this image and the rather dull color doesn''t help it any either.', '2013-01-03 10:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
