(6948037, 1046725, 101256, '<td valign="top">I had to come back to this a couple of times because I couldn''t decide if I liked it or not. I still don''t know if I like it, but that only means that the benefit of the doubt goes to the artist. I like the colors and the edge fade, the lighted Christmas tree kind of blends into the back ground and doesn''t really stand out. I''m also not a big fan of blue snow.</td>', 'I had to come back to this a couple of times because I couldn''t decide if I liked it or not. I still don''t know if I like it, but that only means that the benefit of the doubt goes to the artist. I like the colors and the edge fade, the lighted Christmas tree kind of blends into the back ground and doesn''t really stand out. I''m also not a big fan of blue snow.', '2013-01-03 10:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948038, 1046421, 63218, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1038123" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg"/></a> <br/>The Flying Pig awarded in recognition of fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenges. See previous awards &amp; comments in <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1171726&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">The Flying Pig</a> thread.<br/> <br/>The title is like a line from a poem or song. The drama of light &amp; shadow, the sense of a story, allows my imagination to create its own narrative. That''s better treat than the finest champagne. After I enjoy the semi-familiar in this work of art, my gaze settles on the unfamiliar. The white light dripping on the wall, the animalistic shadow with one white paw draped over the corner, the doll''s face with the reflective nose. Or is it a window? I''m left wondering if these friends live only in your wallet. It feels a little sad.<br/> <br/>Cheers to you for this excellent work of art.</td>', ' The Flying Pig awarded in recognition of fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenges. See previous awards & comments in The Flying Pig thread. The title is like a line from a poem or song. The drama of light & shadow, the sense of a story, allows my imagination to create its own narrative. That''s better treat than the finest champagne. After I enjoy the semi-familiar in this work of art, my gaze settles on the unfamiliar. The white light dripping on the wall, the animalistic shadow with one white paw draped over the corner, the doll''s face with the reflective nose. Or is it a window? I''m left wondering if these friends live only in your wallet. It feels a little sad. Cheers to you for this excellent work of art.', '2013-01-03 10:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948039, 1046708, 101256, '<td valign="top">Reflection shots are always interesting, but this one is terribly disorienting to me for some reason - the left lens reflection is kind of distracting because it isn''t as distinct as the one of the right. Still, a good image.</td>', 'Reflection shots are always interesting, but this one is terribly disorienting to me for some reason - the left lens reflection is kind of distracting because it isn''t as distinct as the one of the right. Still, a good image.', '2013-01-03 10:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948040, 1046721, 101256, '<td valign="top">Too dark, too busy, too much trouble to find what the title suggests.</td>', 'Too dark, too busy, too much trouble to find what the title suggests.', '2013-01-03 10:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948041, 1046500, 63218, '<td valign="top">The blue is lovely. The dark shadow at the top of the frame is intriguing.</td>', 'The blue is lovely. The dark shadow at the top of the frame is intriguing.', '2013-01-03 10:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948046, 1046646, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I don''t get it, but that may be my own failing - O Tannenbaum, while a Christmas Carol, isn''t not about a decorated tree, but the evergreen qualities of the fir tree as a symbol of constancy and faithfulness.  And I''m not sure what all the color mosaic is all about either.</td>', 'I''m afraid I don''t get it, but that may be my own failing - O Tannenbaum, while a Christmas Carol, isn''t not about a decorated tree, but the evergreen qualities of the fir tree as a symbol of constancy and faithfulness.  And I''m not sure what all the color mosaic is all about either.', '2013-01-03 10:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948048, 1046681, 101256, '<td valign="top">I get it, it didn''t work, sorry.</td>', 'I get it, it didn''t work, sorry.', '2013-01-03 11:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948049, 1046640, 101256, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.</td>', 'I don''t get it.', '2013-01-03 11:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948051, 1046698, 101256, '<td valign="top">Finally, somebody who can produce white snow instead of blue snow. That is worth a few point all by itself. Not a very interesting image though.</td>', 'Finally, somebody who can produce white snow instead of blue snow. That is worth a few point all by itself. Not a very interesting image though.', '2013-01-03 11:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948052, 1046711, 63218, '<td valign="top">Aww! Sweet! Where did you get those tiny people &amp; how can I get some? "D Srsly, I wish I could find a card like this, it''s so full of holiday spirit. Beautifully done, including the snow &amp; the DOF. I hope you included some notes!</td>', 'Aww! Sweet! Where did you get those tiny people & how can I get some? "D Srsly, I wish I could find a card like this, it''s so full of holiday spirit. Beautifully done, including the snow & the DOF. I hope you included some notes!', '2013-01-03 11:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948053, 1046733, 101256, '<td valign="top">Now this I like - has a kind of abstract surreal quality to it. The different hues of blue gives it a certain ethereal feeling. Nice capture.</td>', 'Now this I like - has a kind of abstract surreal quality to it. The different hues of blue gives it a certain ethereal feeling. Nice capture.', '2013-01-03 11:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948059, 1046713, 101256, '<td valign="top">Certainly not stock photo quality, but a nice image.  I''m particularly impressed by the striations in the ice that put some real texture to the reflection. Nice capture.</td>', 'Certainly not stock photo quality, but a nice image.  I''m particularly impressed by the striations in the ice that put some real texture to the reflection. Nice capture.', '2013-01-03 11:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948060, 1046421, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very artistic - a Modernist feel to it. While I don''t think it will score high, I certainly appreciate the execution of the image''s subject matter. This is a good one - certainly one of the more creative images in the challenge although most probably won''t agree.</td>', 'Very artistic - a Modernist feel to it. While I don''t think it will score high, I certainly appreciate the execution of the image''s subject matter. This is a good one - certainly one of the more creative images in the challenge although most probably won''t agree.', '2013-01-03 11:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948061, 1046664, 101256, '<td valign="top">Yes - yes it is and unfortunately that''s about all you can say about it. Not a terribly interesting image - I''m not trying to be cruel or offensive, it''s not not....interesting.</td>', 'Yes - yes it is and unfortunately that''s about all you can say about it. Not a terribly interesting image - I''m not trying to be cruel or offensive, it''s not not....interesting.', '2013-01-03 11:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948063, 1046734, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes adding grain or introducing grain into an image by under/over exposing or in post processing works - this not so much.</td>', 'Sometimes adding grain or introducing grain into an image by under/over exposing or in post processing works - this not so much.', '2013-01-03 11:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948065, 1046167, 101256, '<td valign="top">A "golden hour" image - National Geographic photographers would be proud of this one. Great color, nice detail and the lighting is absolutely perfect. Well done.</td>', 'A "golden hour" image - National Geographic photographers would be proud of this one. Great color, nice detail and the lighting is absolutely perfect. Well done.', '2013-01-03 11:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948066, 1046641, 101256, '<td valign="top">The colors are intriguing, but the white blooms at the top distract from the image''s overall impact - in short, no WOW factor. Still interesting.</td>', 'The colors are intriguing, but the white blooms at the top distract from the image''s overall impact - in short, no WOW factor. Still interesting.', '2013-01-03 11:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948068, 1046739, 101256, '<td valign="top">If you had introduced a little less exposure and a different angle on the shot, this would be a much better image. Still, an interesting subject - whimsical and care free.  I like it.</td>', 'If you had introduced a little less exposure and a different angle on the shot, this would be a much better image. Still, an interesting subject - whimsical and care free.  I like it.', '2013-01-03 11:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948070, 1046500, 101256, '<td valign="top">WAY too much blue to be effective. A longer exposure would have helped this a lot. There is a lot of potential here, but the author missed it. Unfortunate.</td>', 'WAY too much blue to be effective. A longer exposure would have helped this a lot. There is a lot of potential here, but the author missed it. Unfortunate.', '2013-01-03 11:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948072, 1046572, 101256, '<td valign="top">I am a big fan of abstract art - this is a very Surrealist image in the style of André Masson. Very interesting use of color.  The title of the piece is also intriguing as it can be interpreted in many ways.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I am a big fan of abstract art - this is a very Surrealist image in the style of André Masson. Very interesting use of color.  The title of the piece is also intriguing as it can be interpreted in many ways.  Nicely done.', '2013-01-03 11:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948073, 1046674, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. It''s a sort of Modernist or Cubist feel to it that is very pleasing. I like the contrasts from left to right, the crisp sharp imagery and the lens flares just make it perfect. Probably not to everyone''s taste, but if I had control of the universe, this would be a challenge winner for sure.</td>', 'I like this a lot. It''s a sort of Modernist or Cubist feel to it that is very pleasing. I like the contrasts from left to right, the crisp sharp imagery and the lens flares just make it perfect. Probably not to everyone''s taste, but if I had control of the universe, this would be a challenge winner for sure.', '2013-01-03 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948075, 1046346, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very pleasing holiday feel to it - peaceful, calm and attractive. Not much more to say - excellent imagery.</td>', 'A very pleasing holiday feel to it - peaceful, calm and attractive. Not much more to say - excellent imagery.', '2013-01-03 11:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948079, 1046736, 101256, '<td valign="top">Getting deep into the challenge and there is some really good imagery here. This is perfect - the very light use of accent color is brilliant, not under or over exposed, crisp and clean - very nice. A high placement in the challenge for sure.</td>', 'Getting deep into the challenge and there is some really good imagery here. This is perfect - the very light use of accent color is brilliant, not under or over exposed, crisp and clean - very nice. A high placement in the challenge for sure.', '2013-01-03 11:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948082, 1046407, 101256, '<td valign="top">That model should have been paid a ton of money for laying in the snow like that. :&gt;)  I like it - very different concept. And WHITE SNOW!! There''s a ten just for white, not blue snow - although there is a little blue around the edges - I''ll discount that. Interesting image - well done.</td>', 'That model should have been paid a ton of money for laying in the snow like that. :>)  I like it - very different concept. And WHITE SNOW!! There''s a ten just for white, not blue snow - although there is a little blue around the edges - I''ll discount that. Interesting image - well done.', '2013-01-03 11:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948084, 1046374, 101256, '<td valign="top">Nice light touch with the color, interesting details here and there, but overall not much WOW factor. A good snapshot quality image. I might have played with the highlight/shadow controls a little or maybe a little more saturation would have helped.</td>', 'Nice light touch with the color, interesting details here and there, but overall not much WOW factor. A good snapshot quality image. I might have played with the highlight/shadow controls a little or maybe a little more saturation would have helped.', '2013-01-03 11:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948085, 1046665, 101256, '<td valign="top">I read a lot and fantasy is one of my favorite genres. This reminds me of Queen Mab, the Winter Queen of the Fae. Probably not to everyone''s taste, but it is fine by me. Nice job.</td>', 'I read a lot and fantasy is one of my favorite genres. This reminds me of Queen Mab, the Winter Queen of the Fae. Probably not to everyone''s taste, but it is fine by me. Nice job.', '2013-01-03 11:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948087, 1046740, 101256, '<td valign="top">A fun image which is a very nice change of pace for this challenge. A ten just for being different and fun.</td>', 'A fun image which is a very nice change of pace for this challenge. A ten just for being different and fun.', '2013-01-03 11:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948088, 1046710, 101256, '<td valign="top">I had the hardest time deciphering the December on the right - don''t know why, but I''d be curious if others had the same impression. A nice family photo - and a good looking family to boot. I''m not sure about the tinting - it''s not something that I would do - I might have tried different color contrasts just for giggles.  Still it works and I like it.</td>', 'I had the hardest time deciphering the December on the right - don''t know why, but I''d be curious if others had the same impression. A nice family photo - and a good looking family to boot. I''m not sure about the tinting - it''s not something that I would do - I might have tried different color contrasts just for giggles.  Still it works and I like it.', '2013-01-03 11:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948090, 1046452, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very different and unique. I think I get the concept - at least I hope I do because I''m giving this a good score. Well done.</td>', 'Very different and unique. I think I get the concept - at least I hope I do because I''m giving this a good score. Well done.', '2013-01-03 11:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
