(6948151, 1046665, 37999, '<td valign="top">Snow is very difficult to photograph. Unfortunately the mark was missed in this photo. It is too dark and that is usually what happens when a person depends on the camera to give them the exposure and f-stop values. The composition is also a bit off on the bottom. To much of a solid white. Maybe if the exposure was correct it would come across differently.  3</td>', 'Snow is very difficult to photograph. Unfortunately the mark was missed in this photo. It is too dark and that is usually what happens when a person depends on the camera to give them the exposure and f-stop values. The composition is also a bit off on the bottom. To much of a solid white. Maybe if the exposure was correct it would come across differently.  3', '2013-01-03 12:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948153, 1046740, 37999, '<td valign="top">Woo-Hoo family Christmas party photos!!! Don''t know how much of this is staged by you or just by chance but it looks like a fun time. I''d say ''Kookiness'' is a good tittle for your photo! I don''t have much in order of comments because I feel as though you could not have really controlled this photo. 6</td>', 'Woo-Hoo family Christmas party photos!!! Don''t know how much of this is staged by you or just by chance but it looks like a fun time. I''d say ''Kookiness'' is a good tittle for your photo! I don''t have much in order of comments because I feel as though you could not have really controlled this photo. 6', '2013-01-03 12:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948159, 1046537, 37999, '<td valign="top">This photo is Okay.Unfortunately some of the lighting is off. All the images are lite unevenly. I like how the light is shining on the red ornament in some spots. Maybe if there were more of this it would be better. If feels as if the silver bells got most of the light and everything else is just there. 4</td>', 'This photo is Okay.Unfortunately some of the lighting is off. All the images are lite unevenly. I like how the light is shining on the red ornament in some spots. Maybe if there were more of this it would be better. If feels as if the silver bells got most of the light and everything else is just there. 4', '2013-01-03 12:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948165, 1046725, 37999, '<td valign="top">This looks like a Christmas card. That can be either good or bad. My first impression was bad Christmas card. If it weren''t for the extra snow in the foreground I think I might like this photo better. Some people may like this the way it is though. Everyone has different feelings for holiday cards. :)  5</td>', 'This looks like a Christmas card. That can be either good or bad. My first impression was bad Christmas card. If it weren''t for the extra snow in the foreground I think I might like this photo better. Some people may like this the way it is though. Everyone has different feelings for holiday cards. :)  5', '2013-01-03 12:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948169, 1046664, 37999, '<td valign="top">To me this photo seems gloomy. I feel as though I''ve been murdered and this is my last view. However, I do like how the sun is shining through the tree in the left. It might just be the composition. Maybe you were going for a different view. Everyone has different perspectives. 5</td>', 'To me this photo seems gloomy. I feel as though I''ve been murdered and this is my last view. However, I do like how the sun is shining through the tree in the left. It might just be the composition. Maybe you were going for a different view. Everyone has different perspectives. 5', '2013-01-03 12:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948172, 1046346, 37999, '<td valign="top">awwww so cute. A little girl in the snow with her snow globe! Hello Kitty ear-muffs and all! The tree in the snow globe is a little to out there and in your face for me. I don''t know if you boosted this of if that is how it came out but it is a bit distracting to me. One other thing I noticed first off is that it seems the snow is centered on her and not the whole photo. I don''t know if this is correct or not but did you drop the snow on her? Overall=7</td>', 'awwww so cute. A little girl in the snow with her snow globe! Hello Kitty ear-muffs and all! The tree in the snow globe is a little to out there and in your face for me. I don''t know if you boosted this of if that is how it came out but it is a bit distracting to me. One other thing I noticed first off is that it seems the snow is centered on her and not the whole photo. I don''t know if this is correct or not but did you drop the snow on her? Overall=7', '2013-01-03 12:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
