(6948437, 1046721, 63218, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1046796" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg"/></a> <br/>The Flying Pig Honorable Mention is awarded in recognition of fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenges. See previous awards &amp; comments in <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1171726&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">The Flying Pig</a> thread.<br/> <br/>The Cask of Amantillado you say? Down here, in the catacombs?<br/> <br/>I looked carefully (and cautiously) for a skull, or the bones of a hand still inside a rusted manacle...but no. The shadows hint at so much--the longer I look at this the more my imagination thinks it might see, or smell. Thanks!</td>', ' The Flying Pig Honorable Mention is awarded in recognition of fine art created with photography, especially in Expert editing challenges. See previous awards & comments in The Flying Pig thread. The Cask of Amantillado you say? Down here, in the catacombs? I looked carefully (and cautiously) for a skull, or the bones of a hand still inside a rusted manacle...but no. The shadows hint at so much--the longer I look at this the more my imagination thinks it might see, or smell. Thanks!', '2013-01-03 19:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
