(6948713, 1046717, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m dying to know what your dad thought of it all, especially the wrapped furniture.... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>My parents are always very entertained by my "strange ideas", as they call them. The wrapped furniture was no exception: they even kept them wrapped a few days for fun. While they know I enter my images in online challenges, they don''t know about DPC, and were very curious about the result: I will call them tomorrow - my father is going to be very proud of winning his first ribbon :)</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: I''m dying to know what your dad thought of it all, especially the wrapped furniture....   My parents are always very entertained by my "strange ideas", as they call them. The wrapped furniture was no exception: they even kept them wrapped a few days for fun. While they know I enter my images in online challenges, they don''t know about DPC, and were very curious about the result: I will call them tomorrow - my father is going to be very proud of winning his first ribbon :)', '2013-01-04 02:20:14.000000', NULL, 0),
