(6949852, 1046739, 83313, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> You say "snapshotty" like it''s a bad word... </i></td></tr></table> <br/>On DPC it usually is. But I think even snapshots benefit from some effective composition. I''ll try putting it on the roof next year, and maybe make a family of bike deer. The batteries in the nose will be harder to change up there, however.</td>', 'Originally posted by bvy: You say "snapshotty" like it''s a bad word...  On DPC it usually is. But I think even snapshots benefit from some effective composition. I''ll try putting it on the roof next year, and maybe make a family of bike deer. The batteries in the nose will be harder to change up there, however.', '2013-01-05 17:38:57.000000', NULL, 0),
