(6950423, 1046711, 138630, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> I find the chocolate wrappers, if that''s what they are, to be very distracting. The scene is also a little contrite.  I love the falling snow though, still I''m sure it will do well for you! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Like Anita, I find the oof candies distracting and would have preferred the scene without them - of course it''s contrived and adorably so.  I agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=63218" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">pixelpig</a> - would make a fun card.  Congratulations on the HM.</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: I find the chocolate wrappers, if that''s what they are, to be very distracting. The scene is also a little contrite.  I love the falling snow though, still I''m sure it will do well for you!   Like Anita, I find the oof candies distracting and would have preferred the scene without them - of course it''s contrived and adorably so.  I agree with  pixelpig - would make a fun card.  Congratulations on the HM.', '2013-01-06 12:56:07.000000', NULL, 0),
