(6953965, 1046640, 67258, '<td valign="top">To any one who was concerned or upset by the photo, it is quite clear that the cat wasn''t in the least bit bothered - at the least alarm a cat''s tail bristles to double it''s size, but here the cat is completely relaxed.</td>', 'To any one who was concerned or upset by the photo, it is quite clear that the cat wasn''t in the least bit bothered - at the least alarm a cat''s tail bristles to double it''s size, but here the cat is completely relaxed.', '2013-01-10 04:16:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6954425, 1046640, 6519, '<td valign="top">I really enjoyed this shot because I, too, have a dog and a cat who are best friends. They sometimes wrestle and "fight" and an outsider would probably get concerned if they saw a photo of them doing it without knowing the very happy outcome.<br/> <br/>This isn''t some amazing piece of art, but I enjoy the bright colours and the frenzied activity. It is a very lovely snapshot and I''m glad you''re not upset that it didn''t do well on DPC.</td>', 'I really enjoyed this shot because I, too, have a dog and a cat who are best friends. They sometimes wrestle and "fight" and an outsider would probably get concerned if they saw a photo of them doing it without knowing the very happy outcome. This isn''t some amazing piece of art, but I enjoy the bright colours and the frenzied activity. It is a very lovely snapshot and I''m glad you''re not upset that it didn''t do well on DPC.', '2013-01-10 16:00:27.000000', NULL, 0),
